WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.800
 Hey, Marvel fans.

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:01.950
We're here with Amy Pascal.

00:00:01.950 --> 00:00:03.960
This is an incredible movie.

00:00:03.960 --> 00:00:06.095
What does it feel like to get
this off the ground running?

00:00:06.095 --> 00:00:08.340
 Look, it's fantastic.

00:00:08.340 --> 00:00:10.590
People are out,
people are excited,

00:00:10.590 --> 00:00:11.800
people love Spider Man.

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:12.600
It's great.

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:14.910
 So Spider Man, talk about
the love of Spider Man.

00:00:14.910 --> 00:00:16.059
He's so relatable.

00:00:16.059 --> 00:00:18.150
What makes Spider Man
so beloved by all?

00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:19.740
 I think because
Spider Man means

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:22.320
something different to
everyone at different ages

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:23.460
in their life.

00:00:23.460 --> 00:00:25.710
When you're a little
kid, it means one thing.

00:00:25.710 --> 00:00:27.540
When you're a teenager,
something else.

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:30.330
And when you're a grown
up, something else.

00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:34.690
It's a boy who's always
struggling with being good,

00:00:34.690 --> 00:00:36.645
and I think we all
understand that.

00:00:36.645 --> 00:00:38.490
 We were able to bring
the super villains

00:00:38.490 --> 00:00:41.040
from previous Spider
Man into this film.

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:42.330
What was that process like?

00:00:42.330 --> 00:00:46.320
 It was fantastic because of
course I had worked with all

00:00:46.320 --> 00:00:48.690
of them on the other
films, and it was really

00:00:48.690 --> 00:00:49.835
exciting to bring them back.

00:00:49.835 --> 00:00:51.730
 Out of your entire
Spider Man journey,

00:00:51.730 --> 00:00:53.070
what are you most proud of?

00:00:53.070 --> 00:00:55.995
 Tonight, of course.

00:00:55.995 --> 00:00:56.980
 Amy, thank you so much.

00:00:56.980 --> 00:00:57.780
Enjoy the movie.

00:00:57.780 --> 00:00:58.800
Thank you so much.

00:00:58.800 --> 00:01:02.750
[MUSIC PLAYING]

